//Preceded by "The next battle will take place"

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionElectricTerrain
with the battlefield electrified!\pGrounded Pok\emon can't fall asleep\nand have stronger Electric-moves!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionGrassyTerrain
with the battlefield grassy!\pGrounded Pok\emon have stronger\nGrass-moves and heal every turn!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionMistyTerrain
with the battlefield misty!\pGrounded Pok\emon have stronger\nFairy-moves and can't be afflicted\lwith status conditions!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionPsychicTerrain
with the battlefield weird!\pGrounded Pok\emon have stronger\nPsychic-moves and can't be hit\lby priority moves!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionRain
in the rain!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionSun
in the sun!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionSandstorm
in a sandstorm!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionHail
in a hailstorm!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionDeltaStream
with strong winds blowing!\pFlying-type Pok\emon take less\ndamage from super effective moves!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionTrickRoom
in a Trick Room!\pSlower Pok\emon get to move first!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionMagicRoom
in a Magic Room!\pMost held items have no effect!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionWonderRoom
in a Wonder Room!\pDefense and Sp. Def stats are\nswapped!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionGravity
with intense gravity!\pNo Pok\emon will remain airborne!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionMagnetRise
with electromagnetism on the field!\pElectric- and Steel-type Pok\emon\ncan't be hit by Ground-type moves!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionFairyLock
with the battlefield locked down!\pNo Pok\emon will be able to switch\nout!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionPixies
with pixies in the air!\pFairy-type Pok\emon will have their\nlowest defensive stat boosted!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionBadThoughts
with negative emotions in the air!\pPok\emon that aren't part Dark-\ntype, Ghost-type, Psychic-type,\lor have one of the Abilities\lUnaware, Oblivious, or Magic Guard\lwill be hurt each turn!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionInverseBattle
in an Inverse Battle!\pAll type matchups are reversed!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionDynamax
with a Power Spot active!\pAll Pok\emon will be able to\nDynamax!\pHowever, no Pok\emon may Mega\nEvolve, undergo Primal Reversion,\lUltra Burst, or use Z-Moves!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionTradeMon
with Pok\emon swapped!\pEach side will use one of the\nopposing side's Pok\emon at random!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionSafeguard
with a veil protecting both sides\lof the battlefield!\pNo Pok\emon may inflict status\nconditions on another!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionMist
with Mist surrounding both sides\lof the battlefield!\pNo Pok\emon may have their stats\nlowered by another!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionSeaOfFire
with a Sea of Fire engulfing both\lsides of the battlefield!\pAll non-Fire-type Pok\emon will be\ndamaged each turn!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionRainbow
with a Rainbow present on both\lsides of the battlefield!\pAll moves have their secondary\neffect chance doubled!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionConfused
with all Pok\emon confused!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionTaunt
with all Pok\emon taunted!\pNo status moves can be used!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionTorment
with all Pok\emon tormented!\pNo move can be used twice in a row.

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionHealBlock
with all Pok\emon Heal Blocked!\pNo Pok\emon will be able to heal!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionThroatChop
with all Pok\emon Throat Chopped!\pNo sound-based moves can be used!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionAlwaysCrit
with all Pok\emon Laser Focused!\pMoves will always score critical\nhits!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionNoCrits
with no Pok\emon being able to\lscore a critical hit!

#org @gText_BattleSimDescriptionAbilitySuppression
with all Pok\emon having their\labilities suppressed!
